# Project Guidance

## Rule Set

- `.rules/ruleset.yaml` is the shared project Rule Set and records every selected Adapter.
- Claude Base Rules, Skills, and Agents remain user-level managed resources; do not copy or link them into this project.

## Responsibilities

- **Rule** defines constraints and triggers; read the relevant Base Rule before acting.
- **Skill** provides a reusable workflow for executing a Rule-governed task.
- **Agent** coordinates a bounded role and may invoke the Skills declared for it.

## Project Growth

- Add project facts or narrower execution detail as `.claude/rules/<rule-id>.project.md`.
- Add project-owned workflows under `.claude/skills/<skill-id>/SKILL.md`.
- Add project-owned roles under `.claude/agents/<agent-id>.md`.
- Local resources extend the project; never copy or link user-level Claude Base resources here.

## Project Rule Extensions

- Read non-empty project-owned extensions from `.claude/rules/<rule-id>.project.md` when present.
- Extensions may add project facts, narrow paths, or add execution detail.
- Extensions must not negate a Base MUST or permit behavior forbidden by a Base MUST NOT.
- This guide and all project extensions are project-owned after initialization.
